\n\n  \n\n**What will your job entail?**\n**Key Responsibilities**\n* Develop and execute performance, load, stress, and endurance tests for applications and systems.\n* Analyze test results, identify bottlenecks, and perform root cause analysis for performance issues.\n* Implement and maintain monitoring tools to track performance metrics.\n* Collaborate with developers, QA, and DevOps teams to ensure performance requirements are integrated early in the development lifecycle.\n* Document test plans, results, and provide actionable recommendations.\n* Integrate test scripts within CI/CD pipelines for efficient execution.\n* Monitor application performance using APM tools (e.g., Datadog, New Relic), Grafana, Prometheus, or Splunk), providing actionable insights.\n* Generate performance reports and present findings to management and stakeholders.\n* Mentor teams on performance best practices and foster a performance\\-aware culture.\n* Design and document performance testing processes and best practices.\n\n\n**Required Skills \\& Qualifications**\n* Bachelor\u2019s degree required, master\u2019s degree preferred; Software Engineering, Computer Science degree is preferred. Any other related discipline or commensurate work experience considered.\n* Minimum of 8 years of experience in performance engineering or related roles\n* Hands\\-on experience with performance testing tools (e.g., JMeter, LoadRunner, Gatling).\n* Familiarity with monitoring tools (e.g., Dynatrace, AppDynamics, New Relic).\n* Proficiency in scripting/programming languages (e.g., Java, Python, Shell).\n* Deep understanding of system architecture, networking, and database performance tuning.\n* Exposure to cloud platforms (e.g. AWS, Azure, GCP) with experience reading logs and viewing usage metrics within (e.g. Azure Monitor, Application Insights, Amazon CloudWatch, AWS X\\-Ray).\n* Exposure making updates and improvements to CICD pipelines.\n\n\n**Preferred Qualifications**\n* Experience with microservices and containerization (Docker, Kubernetes).\n* Knowledge of APM tools and distributed tracing.\n* Relevant certifications in performance testing or cloud technologies.\n\n\n**Disclaimer**\n Ryan Specialty is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are committed to building and sustaining a diverse workforce throughout the organization. Our vision is an inclusive and equitable workplace where all employees are valued for and evaluated on their performance and contributions. Differences in race, creed, color, religious beliefs, physical or mental capabilities, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, and many other characteristics bring together varied perspectives and add value to the service we provide our clients, trading partners, and communities. This policy extends to all aspects of our employment practices, including but not limited to, recruiting, hiring, discipline, firing, promoting, transferring, compensation, benefits, training, leaves of absence, and other terms, conditions, and benefits of employment.","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4452838031","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4452838031"},{"title":"Corporate IT Audit Associate","company":"Nielsen","location":"India","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4452801857","experience":"4 Yrs","skills":[1,12,31,33,35,43,100,103,104,110,111],"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4452801857","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4452801857"},{"title":"Quality Engineer","company":"Grid Dynamics","location":"India","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4455603491","experience":"5 Yrs","skills":[2,3,14,30,102],"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4455603491","permanent_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4455603491"},{"title":"Fortinet Build, Test & Integration Engineer","company":"Prodapt","location":"India","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4456781027","experience":"7 Yrs","skills":[1,14,15,35,100,103],"